      "dcDescription": [
        "1936.33.0001 Laguna Los Pajaros, Prov.Formosa,  Argentina. Laguna Los Pajaros, prov. Formosa, Argentina Laguna Los Pajaros, engelsk missionsstation i provinsen Formosa, Argentina. [[Haga]] Toba-Pilaga Argentina Qom Toba Teckningar utförda av flickan Denoki, 13-14 år.\n1=Dog\n2=man\n3=woman\n4=sun\n\n5=moon\n6=jaguar\n7=snake\n8=parrot\n9=algarroba tree\n10=face tattoos (the girls did face tattoes of women and the boys did those of the man).\n\nNumber 4 is the little value for the words for the \"picture of the sun\" are the same as for their words for \"clock\", and as can drawn a picture of a clock. missionär"
